<Layout title="Privacy notice"><section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">POLICIES</span><h1>Privacy notice</h1><p class="lede">How the initial static CaretDev site handles information.</p></div></section><section class="content-section"><div class="container rich-text"><p><strong>Last updated:</strong> 21 November 2026</p><h2>Contact information</h2><p>You may contact CaretDev at <a href="mailto:info@caretdev.com">info@caretdev.com</a>.</p><h2>Contact and early access enquiries</h2><p>The current site does not host a server-side contact form. Early access enquiries are composed as email drafts in your own email application. No information is submitted unless you choose to send the message.</p><p>If you email us, we use the information in your message to understand the enquiry, respond and, if appropriate, discuss a potential business relationship. Do not include passwords, health information, production data or other sensitive material in an initial enquiry.</p><h2>Hosting and third parties</h2><p>This site may be hosted by GitHub Pages or Cloudflare Pages. The hosting provider may process routine request logs and technical information according to its own policies. Google Fonts is requested by the browser to display typography, and GitHub links take you to an external service.</p><h2>Analytics and cookies</h2><p>This starter project does not include marketing analytics, advertising trackers or a cookie banner. If analytics or new third-party services are added, this notice should be reviewed and updated before launch.</p><h2>Data requests</h2><p>To ask questions about information you have sent or request deletion, email <a href="mailto:info@caretdev.com">info@caretdev.com</a>.</p><div class="notice">Review this starter notice with the company’s actual legal and operational practices before publishing to the public domain.</div></div></section></Layout>
